  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Canvas Ammo Shoulder Bag is designed with a vintage military look, offering an all-in-one place to carry your everyday essentials. This compact shoulder bag keeps your possessions close to you through a crossbody design, and is also great for shooting sports and MilSim. Whether it&rsquo;s a day at the range or a few rounds of airsoft, these ammo bags are up to the task!</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "8932",
  "description": "<p>Our Canvas Ammo Shoulder Bag is designed with a vintage military look, offering an all-in-one place to carry your everyday essentials. This compact shoulder bag keeps your possessions close to you through a crossbody design, and is also great for shooting sports and MilSim. Whether it&rsquo;s a day at the range or a few rounds of airsoft, these ammo bags are up to the task!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Top Grade Canvas:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Made from Rothco&rsquo;s durable heavyweight canvas fabric, this superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. No one comes close to Rothco&rsquo;s collection of ultra-premium canvas bags and packs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Spacious Main Compartment:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The military-styled bag measures 10 inch x 8 inch x 3.5 inch, and is ideal for everyday carry items, such as a small tablet, water bottle, camera, notepad, phone, wallet, and more. Keep your gear secure under the 2 side flap covers and the front flap with a metal fold-over buckle closure.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Additional Storage:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The crossbody bag also features 2 hook &amp; loop pockets for storing smaller items and accessories, including earphones, writing utensils, loose change, travel tickets, and more.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Multiple Carry Options:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These heavy-duty canvas bags come equipped with an adjustable shoulder strap that extends up to 54 inches, giving you the option to wear as a crossbody bag, or either around your neck or shoulder. The shoulder strap is reinforced with Box &ldquo;X&rdquo; stitching for enhanced durability.</li>\n</ul>",
